  call_err_keyword_name.adam - a keyword where a declaration's name goes
  (PLAN-FUNC KWR, AA.4: one fault, one error): a parameter, a var / const /
  threadstatic item, a local, an inline var, a record field, a type, a
  func: ONE PR0001 at the keyword, taken as the name, so the declaration
  stays whole and nothing after it is reported.
